{"about":["Farlands Journey is a colorful classic adventure platformer game where you play as a little witch fighting the evil forces. Embark on an adventure to recover the stolen heart of your Magical Academy. Discover various magic spells and hats with unique effects. Defeat monsters and their bosses. Solve puzzles by combining platforming skills and magical spells. Collect gems and spend them on upgrades in Magical Academy.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.","See Health Warnings for important health information before using this product."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0618/44e85e90d4d6278291023c2a3a375659e411e41980b4624d.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0618/44e85e90d4d6278291023c2a3a375659e411e41980b4624d.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0618/3d7273fe4e2f6adac1e663e562604892ace1f82afc17d866.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0618/3d7273fe4e2f6adac1e663e562604892ace1f82afc17d866.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0618/057e3c56e16f672f34e5b849f0f410fcddb7577b59461e4c.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0618/057e3c56e16f672f34e5b849f0f410fcddb7577b59461e4c.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0618/4e06ac02bb110e7e940263525f7b7fa59e694cf91030acad.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://